{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115100","id":3185485432,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc693qZ4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115100","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115100.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115100.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115100","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115100/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115100/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115100/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b7136fef73fd134e6d3ff9a80686b66cfaf2491e","number":115100,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix glTF physics shape creation hang when importing from thread","user":{"login":"jackthepunished","id":107313375,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmV43w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107313375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished","html_url":"https://github.com/jackthepunished","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackthepunished/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #115081\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a main thread check for convex and trimesh shape creation in `GLTFPhysicsShape::to_resource()` to prevent a deadlock when importing glTF files with mesh-based physics shapes from a background thread at runtime.\r\n\r\nWhen importing glTF files with convex or trimesh collision shapes from a thread (not the main thread), Godot hangs indefinitely. This happens because of thread-safety inconsistency in `PhysicsServer3DWrapMT`:\r\n\r\n1. `*_shape_create()` functions use `FUNCRID` macro → **direct call** (thread-safe, no queue)\r\n2. `shape_set_data()` uses `FUNC2` macro → **command queue** and waits for physics thread\r\n\r\nThis causes a deadlock:\r\n\r\n1. User thread → creates `ConvexPolygonShape3D` → `shape_create()` direct call (OK)\r\n2. User thread → `set_points()` → `shape_set_data()` → push to command queue, **wait for physics thread**\r\n4. Main thread → `thread.wait_to_finish()` → **wait for user thread**\r\n5. **DEADLOCK**: User thread waits for physics (processed on main), main waits for user thread\r\n\r\nAdd `ERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(!Thread::is_main_thread(), ...)` checks before creating convex and trimesh shapes. This provides a clear error message instead of a silent hang, informing developers that these shapes must be created on the main thread.\r\n\r\nTested with the reproduction case from #115081 - glTF with convex/trimesh physics shapes imported via `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request()`.\r\n\r\nPlatform: MacOS 26.0","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-18T16:26:47Z",